spells from your <strong>Spellbook</strong>.<br>Each spell reacts differently depending on the situation — will you heal, strike, summon lightning, or break the board?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your path on the <strong>branching combat map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy to each encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your run with new power-ups and upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a series of battles, each more dangerous than the last. <br>Survive long enough, and you may even face the true calamities threatening the slime realm...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/b537c0591cce6df22c13e0b5d58d509e.avif?t=1756160910\" width=800 height=422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, you’ll visit the <strong>Shop</strong> — spend your hard-earned money to unlock new <strong>spells</strong> that expand your combat options and combo potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that’s not all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you’ll encounter magical <strong>Wishing Panels</strong>. Make a wish and receive powerful <strong>passive stat boosts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run makes you stronger.<br>Every attempt gets you closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to discover the perfect build and dominate the board?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/996d68012b791344a183511e95ee429f.avif?t=1756160910\" width=800 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/65dc6e84e14ce4160b30c235ead8e8ac.avif?t=1756160910\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Encounters &amp; Dynamic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face <strong>elite monsters</strong> with enhanced health and unique battlefield effects.<br>Some stages will introduce <strong>dynamic lighting</strong> that alters your visibility — changing the way you approach each move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That spell you thought was useless?<br>In the right moment, it might just save your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>boss</strong> not only brings a gameplay challenge, but also their own <strong>original soundtrack</strong>, woven with lore and subtle clues about their origins and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras/710ad0efe127fd067f7334ad60aafd6b.avif?t=1756160910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732840/extras_big/710ad0efe127fd067f7334ad60aafd6b.avif?t=1756160910 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
